4          /*
5          Program name: /udd/nhywa/GUTSOB/secondary_stratified/gwt
6          Pogrammer: Bethsaida Cardona (n2bca)
7          Date started: 07/2025
8          Program Purpose: Calculate RRs and PARs for the association between gestational weight gain and obesity
9          stratified by maternal obesity status
10         Exposures: GOTWEIGHT [binary]
11         Stratifiers: maternal obesity status
12         Statistical Analyses:
13         	1) proc genmod to calculate multivariable log-binomial model with generalized estimating equations (GEE),
14         	a Poisson distribution, and an unstructured correlation structure, accounting for correlations across
15         	time for the same child and between siblings born to the same mother
